  <text>
      <body>
         <div type="performance_playbill" rend="align(center)">
            <ab>Twelfth Time.<lb/>
               Theatre-Royal, Hay-Market.<lb/>
               This <hi rend="allcaps">Evening</hi>, <date when="1811-07-05"><hi rend="allcaps">Friday</hi> July 5, 1811</date>.<lb/>
               Will be presented, an Historical Play, in Three Acts, call'd The<lb/>
               <bibl><title>Royal Oak.</title></bibl><lb/>
               With entire New Scenery, Dresses and Decorations.<lb/>
               The <hi rend="allcaps">New Musick</hi> Composed by Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Kelly</hi>.<lb/>
               <castList>
                  <head>The Characters by</head><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Elliston</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Lewes</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Smith</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Eyre</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Cooper</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Hillington</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Paine</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Noble</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Houghton</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem>Messrs. <actor>Brown,</actor> <actor>Caulfield,</actor> <actor>Diether,</actor> <actor>Eames,</actor> <actor>Field,</actor> <actor>Gray,</actor> <actor>Griffith,</actor> <actor>Hall,</actor> <actor>Harrison,</actor> <actor>Lawson,</actor><lb/>
                     <actor>Oddwell,</actor> <actor>Robert,</actor> <actor>Sherriff,</actor> <actor>Thomson,</actor> <actor>Terry,</actor> <actor>Willoughby,</actor> &amp;c.</castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Mallinson</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">R. Jones</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Martin</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Finn</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Grove</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Shaw</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Minton</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Linton</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem>Mr. <actor><hi rend="allcaps">Miller</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Silver</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Salker</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Taylor</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Thomas</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Wilson</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor>Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Barnes</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor>Miss <hi rend="allcaps">Wheatley</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><actor>Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Grove</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor>Miss <hi rend="allcaps">Watson</hi>,</actor></castItem> <castItem><actor>Miss <hi rend="allcaps">De Camp</hi>,</actor></castItem> <castItem><actor>Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Stokes</hi>,</actor></castItem> <castItem><actor>Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Haughton</hi>,</actor></castItem> <castItem><actor>Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Kendall</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor>Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Glover</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
               </castList>
               <hi rend="italic">The Dresses by Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Tobin</hi> and Miss <hi rend="allcaps">Smith</hi>.</hi><lb/>
               <hi rend="italic">The Scenery designed, and executed by Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">De Maria</hi>, and Assistants.</hi><lb/>
               The Play of The <hi rend="allcaps">Royal Oak</hi>, is published by Messrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Barker</hi>, Russell Street,<lb/>
               Covent-Garden.<lb/>
               <hi rend="italic">After which</hi> <hi rend="allcaps">(Second Time)</hi> <hi rend="italic"><hi rend="allcaps">A New Farce</hi>, (with Songs,) call'd</hi> The<lb/>
               <bibl><title>Outside Passenger.</title></bibl><lb/>
               <hi rend="italic">The Musick entirely new, Composed by Mr. Reeve, Mr. Whitaker, and Mr. D. Corri.</hi><lb/>
               <hi rend="italic">The Overture by Mr. Reeve.</hi><lb/>
               <castList>
                  <head>The Principal Characters by</head>
                  <castItem><actor>Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Liston</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Eyre</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Grove</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Paine</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor>Mr. Noble.</actor></castItem> <castItem><actor>Mr. Finn</actor></castItem> <castItem><actor>Mr. Lewes.</actor></castItem> <castItem><actor>Mr. Minton.</actor></castItem> <castItem><actor>Mr. Widdicombe.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Mallinson</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor>Miss <hi rend="allcaps">Leserve</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><actor>Miss <hi rend="allcaps">Bellchambers</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem>And <actor>Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Gibbs</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
               </castList>
               <hi rend="allcaps">Boxes</hi> <measure type="currency">5s</measure>. <hi rend="allcaps">Pit</hi> <measure type="currency">3s</measure>. <hi rend="allcaps">First Gallery</hi> <measure type="currency">2s</measure>. <hi rend="allcaps">Second Gallery</hi> <measure type="currency">1s</measure>.<lb/>
               The Doors to be Opened at <time when="18:00:00">Six o'Clock</time>, and the Performance to begin at <time when="19:00:00">Seven</time>.<lb/>
               Places for the Boxes to be taken of Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Massingham</hi> at the Theatre.<lb/>
               The Publick is respectfully inform'd, that, the <hi rend="smallcaps">New Farce</hi> call'd The <hi rend="allcaps">Outside</hi><lb/>
               <hi rend="allcaps">Passenger</hi>, having been received with bursts of laughter, and loud peels of applause,<lb/>
               will be repeated, every evening, till further notice</ab>
         </div>
      </body>
